 "Site IDs": [
  657
 ],
 "Site Description": "The hyperspectral spectrometer (FLOX-Ocean Optics) at the EddyCovariance facility (carbonflux\r\ntower) in Adventdalen will give time-series of very detailed spectral properties (spectral resolution\r\n&lt;1 nm) included sun induced fluorescence (of vegetation which will be used for calibration of NDVI-sensors\r\nin Adventdalen. The project (SIOS Instrument #49) is part of the Svalbard Integrated Arctic Earth Observing\r\nSystem and is approved by Longyearbyen lokalstyre.",
