 ],
 "Site Description": "Between June and September, rain precipitation samples are collected every month from rain gauges located around the Hornsund fiord. Usually Bogstranda, Lorchbreen valley, Bautabreen valley, Gåshamna and Lisbetdalen. The totalizer rain gauges are located in the seacoast region.",
