 "Site Description": "From 2020 the sensors are mounted on a kayak that is anchored in the river a bit upstream the flight wreck (heritage site) near the &quot;Old Aurora station&quot; of UNIS.\r\nFrom the beginning in July 2017 until end of September 2019 the station was located at 78 12.233N 015 49.703E. During that period all sensors had been mounted in one fixture that was pushed down into a pipe that was mounted with a descent down into the water on a rigid construction in the river.",
