 "Site Description": "Seismic array consisting of​ 9 seismometers (SPA0,  SPA1, SPA2 , SPA3  , SPB1, SPB2, SPB3,  SPB4, SPB5) .\r\nSPITS is an auxiliary seismic array (AS72) in the IMS International Monitoring System (IMS) which is designed to detect any nuclear explosion conducted on Earth, to verify compliance with the Treaty​\r\nCoordinates of the array elements can be found at: https://www.norsar.no/data/norsar-station-network",
